239.text:
(1) Where under this Act any notice or other document is required or authorised to be served on, or given or delivered to, the Commissioner or any other officer, the notice or other document may be served, given or delivered—
  (a) by delivering it personally to the Commissioner;
  (b) by leaving it at the office of the Commissioner;
  (c) by sending it by post to the Commissioner; or
